# The site is preconfigured with a placeholder production origin: https://lulazel.example
# (RFC 2606 reserved TLD — it can never collide with a real domain). This activates
# canonicals, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, JSON-LD structured data and absolute social cards.
# Before launch, replace it with your real HTTPS domain in Vercel/Netlify environment
# settings (or export it in your shell). The SITE_URL env var overrides site.config.json.
# SITE_URL=https://your-real-domain.co.za
